Error [jet.InvalidSchedule]: A schedule interval must be a positive duration
  --> tests/ui/schedule_bad_duration_zero.jet:2:14
    |
  2 | #Job(every: 0ms) prune_sessions: fn() {
    |              ^^
 Why: `every: 0ms` or a negative duration never becomes due — it isn't a real cadence.
 Fix: Write a duration greater than zero, e.g. `#Job(every: 5min)`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0926
